  "method": "Warm whole-process medians, rotating condition order, builds and output validation excluded; no fsync or CPU isolation. map is per-element transformation plus scalar reduction over 16 MiB, compared with identical direct/inline loops. noinline is a benchmark-only IR attribute on the callback in both direct and HOF programs, preserving actual calls. Sort compares library-style comparator insertion sort versus the core sorting algorithm on descending buffers, including construction and identical output formatting; it does not isolate dispatch or establish general library-sort performance."
